# Builder debt — add every fuckup to handoff

When Builder ships a build that **FAILs** coordinator/audit (regression, crash, blank UI, wrong layout, log proof of broken behavior), **record it** and **paste the running list** into every future BUILDER HANDOFF until fixed and verified in log.

## Record format (one line each)

```
vX.Y.Z | YYYY-MM-DD | symptom | log proof (file:line or re2 line) | root cause (file:line) | status: OPEN|FIXED in vA.B.C
```

## Where to keep the list

- Project file: `QuestTracker-Modded/BUILDER_DEBT.md` — append new rows; mark FIXED when log proves it.
- Every BUILDER HANDOFF block must include:

```
BUILDER DEBT (do not repeat):
  <paste all OPEN rows>
  <last 3 FIXED rows for context>
```

## When to append

- Auditor verdict = FAIL on behavioral P0/P1 after Fluffy install
- Coordinator screenshot + log proof of regression vs prior PASS item
- Same bug class twice → escalate to P0 in handoff ("repeat offense")

## Handoff must also say

- Which debt items this build **claims to fix** (by version + file:line)
- Which debt items are **still OPEN** after ship (honest — no PASS if OPEN)

## Auditor does not edit lua — only updates BUILDER_DEBT.md when logging a new failure (maintenance doc, not game code).

